# This folder is pushed out as a standalone repository with `git subtree`, and
# from there Zenodo archives it. The parent repository sends every .nc to Git
# LFS, which would carry a pointer file instead of the data across that push
# and leave the published package with a worked example that is not there.
# Three megabytes as an ordinary blob costs nothing and keeps the package
# self-contained.
example/*.nc -filter -diff -merge -text
